1
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:48,965
PERFECT CROWN

2
00:00:54,216 --> 00:00:55,631
SPONSORED BY: MINISTRY OF
CULTURE, SPORTS AND TOURISM

3
00:00:55,712 --> 00:00:57,213
AND KOREA CREATIVE
CONTENT AGENCY

4
00:00:57,536 --> 00:00:59,473
MBC DRAMA SCRIPT
CONTEST WINNER

5
00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:01,019
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

6
00:01:01,102 --> 00:01:02,979
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

7
00:01:51,152 --> 00:01:52,946
On behalf of the people and the Cabinet,

8
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:54,864
I offer

9
00:01:55,657 --> 00:01:58,159
my most sincere congratulations
on your union.

10
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:00,787
Congratulations.

11
00:02:01,538 --> 00:02:05,583
Thank…

12
00:02:09,003 --> 00:02:10,171
Seong Huiju.

13
00:02:16,678 --> 00:02:17,679
Seong Huiju.

14
00:02:34,487 --> 00:02:35,655
Seong Huiju!

15
00:02:35,738 --> 00:02:37,907
- Huiju.
- Ms. Seong?

16
00:02:37,991 --> 00:02:39,242
Escort His Majesty.

17
00:02:39,784 --> 00:02:40,910
Your Majesty.

18
00:02:42,203 --> 00:02:44,831
- Summon a royal physician!
- Yes, Your Majesty.

19
00:02:44,914 --> 00:02:46,624
We shall leave the palace.

20
00:02:47,125 --> 00:02:48,376
From this moment forth…

21
00:02:49,878 --> 00:02:54,007
anyone who dares to lay a hand
upon my wife shall face my wrath!

22
00:02:54,507 --> 00:02:55,508
Choi Hyeon!

23
00:02:56,885 --> 00:02:59,304
Your Royal Highness!

24
00:03:00,346 --> 00:03:01,347
Ms. Seong.

25
00:03:01,431 --> 00:03:03,433
- Send word to her father.
- How did this…

26
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:05,935
- Choi Hyeon!
- Yes, Your Royal Highness!

27
00:03:14,402 --> 00:03:15,528
Huiju.

28
00:03:16,112 --> 00:03:17,113
Seong Huiju.

29
00:03:23,119 --> 00:03:27,040
PERFECT CROWN

30
00:03:27,624 --> 00:03:28,958
{\an8}EPISODE 8

31
00:03:29,667 --> 00:03:32,212
{\an8}Can you confirm
whether a plan has been established?

32
00:03:32,295 --> 00:03:34,505
{\an8}Do you care to comment, Ms. Seong?

33
00:03:34,589 --> 00:03:36,758
{\an8}Can you tell us anything?

34
00:03:36,841 --> 00:03:38,593
{\an8}Are you all right, Ms. Seong?

35
00:03:38,676 --> 00:03:40,470
{\an8}Castle Hospital. As fast as you can.

36
00:03:41,387 --> 00:03:42,347
{\an8}Seong Huiju.

37
00:03:49,187 --> 00:03:51,105
{\an8}GRAND PRINCESS SEONG
FAINTS MID-WEDDING

38
00:03:54,484 --> 00:03:55,902
Hold on…

39
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:01,532
Are you all right, sir?

40
00:04:01,616 --> 00:04:03,701
Contact the Ministry of Transport
for traffic control.

41
00:04:03,785 --> 00:04:04,786
Yes, sir.

42
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:08,706
The escort vehicle must reach
Castle Hospital without any delay.

43
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:09,791
Understood, sir.

44
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:11,793
How much of it was broadcast?

45
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:13,419
It was stopped after her collapse.

46
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:19,300
Let them know an official statement
will be issued by day's end.

47
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:22,470
Work with the Royal Guard
on hospital crowd control.

48
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:23,554
Yes, sir.

49
00:04:47,078 --> 00:04:50,498
CASTLE HOSPITAL

50
00:04:50,581 --> 00:04:52,000
Patient status?

51
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:55,003
- Looks serious. Let's check her vitals.
- Yes, Doctor.

52
00:04:55,628 --> 00:04:57,005
HR 32, BP 80 systolic.

53
00:04:57,839 --> 00:04:59,132
Breathing is weak.

54
00:05:00,258 --> 00:05:02,135
HR in the thirties. Prepare atropine.

55
00:05:02,218 --> 00:05:03,386
Yes, Doctor.

56
00:05:05,763 --> 00:05:07,557
Please wait outside, Your Royal Highness.

57
00:05:09,809 --> 00:05:11,477
Injecting 0.5 ml of atropine.

58
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:14,480
No response to the atropine.

59
00:05:14,564 --> 00:05:16,524
Her pulse is dropping, Doctor.

60
00:05:40,089 --> 00:05:42,258
You're going to the hospital, right?
We'll go too.

61
00:05:42,342 --> 00:05:43,801
No, all of you will stay put.

62
00:05:43,885 --> 00:05:45,720
How can we? Her Ladyship collapsed.

63
00:05:45,803 --> 00:05:46,763
We need to go and...

64
00:05:46,846 --> 00:05:50,391
Everything Ms. Seong consumed
or wore today must be secured.

65
00:05:50,892 --> 00:05:53,019
Don't dispose of anything.
Keep it exactly as is.

66
00:05:53,102 --> 00:05:55,563
What? But why would we do that?

67
00:05:55,646 --> 00:05:57,565
From this moment on,
no one, myself included,

68
00:05:58,358 --> 00:05:59,859
is to leave the private residence.

69
00:06:24,634 --> 00:06:25,927
How did this happen?

70
00:06:29,347 --> 00:06:30,515
Your Royal Highness.

71
00:06:31,891 --> 00:06:34,227
The blood test results are back.

72
00:06:39,357 --> 00:06:40,942
<i>She has digoxin toxicity.</i>

73
00:06:43,236 --> 00:06:44,237
Toxicity?

74
00:06:45,238 --> 00:06:47,073
It's medication used to treat arrhythmias,

75
00:06:47,156 --> 00:06:48,282
but an overdose

76
00:06:49,367 --> 00:06:50,868
can be fatal.

77
00:06:51,452 --> 00:06:53,371
What? Fatal?

78
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:54,539
What does that mean?

79
00:06:54,622 --> 00:06:58,084
Fortunately, we gave emergency treatment
before it hit peak levels in the blood.

80
00:06:58,167 --> 00:07:00,128
She's being treated with an antidote now.

81
00:07:00,211 --> 00:07:02,755
It'll take a few hours
for her to stabilize.

82
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:05,716
So she's not dying, right?

83
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,593
- Yes.
- You should've started with that!

84
00:07:07,677 --> 00:07:09,303
Gave me a real heart attack there.

85
00:07:09,387 --> 00:07:10,972
Come on, babe. Don't be like that…

86
00:07:11,055 --> 00:07:13,683
They're leaving already?
Shouldn't they explain more?

87
00:07:13,766 --> 00:07:14,767
Stop it.

88
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,232
- I was so shocked.
- Calm down.

89
00:07:23,276 --> 00:07:24,360
What are you doing?

90
00:07:24,444 --> 00:07:25,736
Stop!

91
00:07:28,114 --> 00:07:29,157
Step back.

92
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:43,087
Surely, you won't just let this slide.

93
00:07:44,547 --> 00:07:45,548
I have…

94
00:07:48,718 --> 00:07:50,470
no intention of letting this slide.

95
00:08:06,819 --> 00:08:08,112
It was due to drug toxicity.

96
00:08:08,696 --> 00:08:09,822
Toxicity?

97
00:08:09,906 --> 00:08:11,032
The attending physician…

98
00:08:11,115 --> 00:08:12,992
Are you saying
someone tried to poison her?

99
00:08:17,413 --> 00:08:19,332
- Where is the Grand Prince right now?
- Sir.

100
00:08:19,415 --> 00:08:21,834
- But now is not…
- Where is Grand Prince I-AN right now?

101
00:08:33,471 --> 00:08:34,597
I knew…

102
00:08:37,475 --> 00:08:39,018
you would fail to protect her.

103
00:08:40,311 --> 00:08:42,146
She collapsed as soon as
she became your wife.

104
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:44,315
You couldn't even keep her safe for a day!

105
00:08:46,567 --> 00:08:47,777
That's why I'm here.

106
00:08:52,198 --> 00:08:53,199
Investigate the palace.

107
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,201
What?

108
00:08:57,078 --> 00:08:59,080
From its staff to the royal family.

109
00:09:02,333 --> 00:09:03,501
Investigate them all.

110
00:09:05,002 --> 00:09:07,338
Do you realize what you're saying...

111
00:09:07,421 --> 00:09:08,464
I do.

112
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:10,258
So just do it.

113
00:09:14,136 --> 00:09:15,221
Effective immediately…

114
00:09:17,848 --> 00:09:19,392
I hereby authorize a public inquiry…

115
00:09:22,687 --> 00:09:23,771
into the palace.

116
00:09:33,072 --> 00:09:34,115
You cannot.

117
00:09:34,949 --> 00:09:37,159
The dignity of the Crown will be sullied.

118
00:09:37,243 --> 00:09:38,661
Is that what you seek?

119
00:09:40,538 --> 00:09:42,498
This incident occurred on palace grounds.

120
00:09:43,916 --> 00:09:47,336
This investigation is imperative,
not only for you and His Majesty's safety,

121
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:48,838
but for the Crown's dignity.

122
00:09:48,921 --> 00:09:51,799
The Royal Protection Branch
can handle that.

123
00:09:51,882 --> 00:09:53,676
An investigation
without privilege is required.

124
00:09:56,637 --> 00:09:57,888
Are you saying…

125
00:10:00,057 --> 00:10:02,143
the royals will be questioned as well?

126
00:10:03,269 --> 00:10:04,645
The Grand Prince authorized it.

127
00:10:04,729 --> 00:10:06,314
I-AN is not the king!

128
00:10:06,397 --> 00:10:07,732
But he serves the Crown…

129
00:10:11,444 --> 00:10:12,695
…as its regent.

130
00:10:18,034 --> 00:10:19,327
So, Your Majesty,

131
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:23,414
please allow the police
to enter the palace.

132
00:10:45,019 --> 00:10:46,395
Before we begin,

133
00:10:47,021 --> 00:10:49,440
we would like to express
our deep concern and regret

134
00:10:49,523 --> 00:10:52,276
over the unfortunate incident
that occurred during the royal wedding.

135
00:10:53,569 --> 00:10:57,156
The Grand Princess was hospitalized
after a medical emergency at the ceremony.

136
00:10:57,239 --> 00:11:00,117
She is presently undergoing treatment
and showing signs of recovery.

137
00:11:00,201 --> 00:11:03,245
You mentioned a medical emergency.
Was there a preexisting condition?

138
00:11:03,329 --> 00:11:05,414
Are external factors being ruled out?

139
00:11:07,792 --> 00:11:10,586
We will take questions
once the statement has concluded.

140
00:11:14,382 --> 00:11:17,426
While the investigation remains ongoing,

141
00:11:18,219 --> 00:11:19,804
concerning factors preclude us

142
00:11:20,471 --> 00:11:22,056
from deeming this a simple accident.

143
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:29,689
<i>Accordingly, at the Crown's request
and in the interest of the public good,</i>

144
00:11:29,772 --> 00:11:31,315
{\an8}<i>the government will launch</i>

145
00:11:32,024 --> 00:11:34,151
<i>a public investigation encompassing</i>

146
00:11:35,236 --> 00:11:37,363
<i>the possibility
of intentional harm or terrorism.</i>

147
00:11:40,449 --> 00:11:44,829
<i>The investigation will proceed
with the Ministry of Justice and the NPA,</i>

148
00:11:44,912 --> 00:11:47,456
<i>and will be conducted thoroughly
and transparently.</i>

149
00:11:48,708 --> 00:11:52,294
No political or external pressure
will be permitted to influence

150
00:11:53,295 --> 00:11:54,964
the pursuit of the truth.

151
00:12:02,054 --> 00:12:04,056
She didn't eat anything
at the palace that day.

152
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:07,351
Then, do you remember everything she had
at the private residence?

153
00:12:07,435 --> 00:12:10,312
Uh… She didn't have much of an appetite,

154
00:12:10,396 --> 00:12:12,356
so she only had
half an apple in the morning.

155
00:12:13,232 --> 00:12:15,609
I heard she normally has trouble sleeping.

156
00:12:15,693 --> 00:12:17,403
I wouldn't exactly call it that.

157
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:18,946
She just doesn't sleep.

158
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:20,948
She doesn't sleep?

159
00:12:21,031 --> 00:12:23,659
She works through the night in the study.

160
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:25,494
PERSONAL DETAILS
LEE AREUM

161
00:12:25,578 --> 00:12:28,247
MOTHER: PARK MALJA

162
00:12:43,804 --> 00:12:46,307
<i>No sacred exceptions
in the pursuit of truth.</i>

163
00:12:46,807 --> 00:12:48,225
<i>The palace</i>

164
00:12:49,018 --> 00:12:50,269
<i>will certainly not be exempt.</i>

165
00:12:51,228 --> 00:12:52,354
<i>In the eyes of the law…</i>

166
00:12:52,438 --> 00:12:53,898
Prime Minister Min can be so scary.

167
00:12:54,690 --> 00:12:56,108
It's definitely a bold move.

168
00:12:57,109 --> 00:12:59,069
Isn't this the first time the Crown

169
00:12:59,862 --> 00:13:01,363
is being investigated?

170
00:13:02,156 --> 00:13:03,240
It is.

171
00:13:03,324 --> 00:13:04,325
What?

172
00:13:04,408 --> 00:13:06,452
Are royals untouchable in investigations?

173
00:13:07,536 --> 00:13:08,913
- Inviolable.
- Right.

174
00:13:10,915 --> 00:13:13,626
Not exactly. It's more like…

175
00:13:14,251 --> 00:13:16,587
But are you two ever going home?

176
00:13:17,171 --> 00:13:19,423
Father told us to stay until she wakes up.

177
00:13:19,507 --> 00:13:20,883
Father is worried…

178
00:13:23,219 --> 00:13:25,221
Wait, I think she moved!

179
00:13:25,304 --> 00:13:26,305
What?

180
00:13:30,226 --> 00:13:33,687
Huiju, can you hear me?

181
00:13:40,027 --> 00:13:41,153
Ms. Seong!

182
00:13:41,987 --> 00:13:43,447
It's me! Hyeon!

183
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:48,869
<i>Ms. Seong is awake!</i>

184
00:13:48,953 --> 00:13:50,454
Thank goodness.

185
00:13:52,665 --> 00:13:54,041
Does His Royal Highness know?

186
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:22,945
KING HUIJONG THE GREAT
QUEEN UIHYEON

187
00:14:25,614 --> 00:14:26,949
Father…

188
00:14:30,953 --> 00:14:32,872
How dare you mock

189
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:35,708
the Crown Prince's authority!

190
00:14:40,629 --> 00:14:42,423
Was I being too greedy again?

191
00:14:47,136 --> 00:14:48,137
Hence…

192
00:14:50,347 --> 00:14:51,682
Is this your wrath,

193
00:14:53,434 --> 00:14:55,019
reminding me not to covet?

194
00:14:58,856 --> 00:15:00,107
How much longer…

195
00:15:01,859 --> 00:15:03,193
Your Royal Highness.

196
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:07,448
They say she is awake now.

197
00:15:10,492 --> 00:15:12,870
Please slow down,
Your Royal Highness!

198
00:15:16,123 --> 00:15:17,291
Your Royal Highness.

199
00:15:17,374 --> 00:15:18,667
Please slow down.

200
00:15:19,251 --> 00:15:21,128
You will hurt yourself,
Your Royal Highness!

201
00:15:44,735 --> 00:15:45,945
You must be hungry.

202
00:15:48,113 --> 00:15:49,114
Your Royal Highness.

203
00:16:28,362 --> 00:16:29,613
You're okay, right?

204
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,960
Are you okay now?

205
00:16:45,713 --> 00:16:46,755
Are you crying?

206
00:17:01,562 --> 00:17:02,771
I thought you were dying.

207
00:17:03,981 --> 00:17:05,190
I thought I lost you.

208
00:17:07,234 --> 00:17:08,318
I really thought…

209
00:17:32,509 --> 00:17:33,510
I'm okay.

210
00:17:40,809 --> 00:17:42,061
But…

211
00:17:42,728 --> 00:17:44,271
why did I collapse?

212
00:18:11,548 --> 00:18:13,717
This will be a joint investigation
between the NPA

213
00:18:13,801 --> 00:18:15,219
and the Royal Protection Branch.

214
00:18:17,888 --> 00:18:19,056
Today, we are questioning…

215
00:18:22,768 --> 00:18:23,769
It must be me.

216
00:18:34,363 --> 00:18:35,489
You stay here.

217
00:18:35,572 --> 00:18:36,573
Me?

218
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:40,786
Stay with Seong Huiju.

219
00:18:42,246 --> 00:18:43,247
Never leave her side.

220
00:18:48,168 --> 00:18:49,294
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

221
00:18:49,378 --> 00:18:50,754
Leave everything here to me.

222
00:18:57,845 --> 00:18:58,846
<i>What?</i>

223
00:18:59,429 --> 00:19:00,430
Toxicity?

224
00:19:01,181 --> 00:19:02,182
Me?

225
00:19:03,892 --> 00:19:05,769
I barely even take sleeping aids anymore.

226
00:19:10,315 --> 00:19:14,570
Just spit it out already.
Why won't anybody tell me anything?

227
00:19:16,697 --> 00:19:18,323
It looks deliberate.

228
00:19:19,491 --> 00:19:21,243
It's not a medication you normally take.

229
00:19:21,910 --> 00:19:24,037
Even if it were,
the amount found in your system…

230
00:19:28,584 --> 00:19:29,710
You don't need to worry.

231
00:19:30,294 --> 00:19:32,254
The investigation is underway,
and the government…

232
00:19:32,337 --> 00:19:33,338
And His Royal Highness?

233
00:19:37,217 --> 00:19:38,760
The medication he usually takes…

234
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:41,096
Did you check those?

235
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:45,809
SEOUL METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

236
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:53,275
Did Her Royal Highness mention

237
00:19:53,358 --> 00:19:55,485
any abnormal symptoms prior to collapsing?

238
00:19:57,154 --> 00:19:58,155
No.

239
00:19:58,238 --> 00:20:01,074
Any preexisting conditions or allergies?

240
00:20:01,158 --> 00:20:05,245
Did you not review the report
prepared by my wife's attending physician?

241
00:20:10,459 --> 00:20:12,753
Her blood test results

242
00:20:13,962 --> 00:20:15,839
confirmed digoxin toxicity.

243
00:20:18,175 --> 00:20:21,303
By chance,
are you familiar with this medication?

244
00:20:21,386 --> 00:20:24,681
That's not a question
we agreed on beforehand.

245
00:20:25,641 --> 00:20:26,808
I am familiar.

246
00:20:27,851 --> 00:20:28,977
Your Royal Highness.

247
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:32,648
It is a medication

248
00:20:34,566 --> 00:20:35,984
I have taken on occasion.

249
00:20:36,944 --> 00:20:38,528
Have you checked or not?

250
00:20:39,571 --> 00:20:40,572
Huiju.

251
00:20:46,662 --> 00:20:48,205
I made a mistake.

252
00:20:51,708 --> 00:20:53,752
<i>The robe was so heavy,
and I tripped.</i>

253
00:20:55,879 --> 00:20:57,756
<i>I fell against the table.</i>

254
00:20:59,049 --> 00:21:00,968
<i>Ms. Do put the goblets back in place.</i>

255
00:21:01,051 --> 00:21:02,552
That's when they were switched.

256
00:21:03,262 --> 00:21:04,554
Our goblets.

257
00:21:10,185 --> 00:21:11,311
Where is he right now?

258
00:21:15,023 --> 00:21:16,233
Huiju.

259
00:21:16,775 --> 00:21:18,610
What are you doing? Calm down!

260
00:21:18,694 --> 00:21:20,112
He's in danger right now!

261
00:21:22,197 --> 00:21:23,740
I believe I was the target.

262
00:21:25,909 --> 00:21:27,244
Your Royal Highness.

263
00:21:27,327 --> 00:21:28,745
May I ask why you think that?

264
00:21:30,163 --> 00:21:32,791
My wife, who doesn't normally
take that medication, survived.

265
00:21:34,584 --> 00:21:35,961
However, had I taken it…

266
00:21:39,089 --> 00:21:40,257
I would have died.

267
00:21:41,883 --> 00:21:43,260
It would've been a fatal dose.

268
00:21:48,765 --> 00:21:50,392
Why are you here? What about…

269
00:21:50,475 --> 00:21:51,560
Please go back inside.

270
00:21:52,144 --> 00:21:53,145
No, I need to...

271
00:21:53,228 --> 00:21:55,147
His Royal Highness commanded that

272
00:21:55,230 --> 00:21:56,940
your safety be placed above all else.

273
00:21:58,692 --> 00:21:59,693
Please go back inside.

274
00:22:00,902 --> 00:22:02,154
You stay here.

275
00:22:06,825 --> 00:22:07,951
I will go…

276
00:22:09,619 --> 00:22:10,746
to His Royal Highness.

277
00:22:55,082 --> 00:22:56,083
And Grand Prince I-AN?

278
00:22:56,583 --> 00:22:59,628
He is currently giving a statement
with Mr. Jung in attendance.

279
00:23:02,964 --> 00:23:03,882
At this hour?

280
00:23:03,965 --> 00:23:06,718
They've already started
searching his private residence too.

281
00:23:07,302 --> 00:23:09,388
All items used for the wedding,

282
00:23:09,471 --> 00:23:11,431
even the vehicles that transported them,

283
00:23:11,932 --> 00:23:13,809
are said to be subject
to search and seizure.

284
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,605
Take care of any potential issues early.

285
00:23:19,147 --> 00:23:20,440
Make it clean, no loose ends.

286
00:23:21,024 --> 00:23:22,317
Do not worry, Your Majesty.

287
00:23:37,541 --> 00:23:38,583
Sir.

288
00:23:38,667 --> 00:23:40,627
These are the personnel files
you asked for.

289
00:23:42,254 --> 00:23:45,799
They include the attendants' family ties,
changes in assets, and their whereabouts

290
00:23:45,882 --> 00:23:47,676
and call history over the past month.

291
00:23:48,218 --> 00:23:49,803
And the Grand Prince's medical records?

292
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:53,640
Everyone who accessed it recently

293
00:23:53,723 --> 00:23:55,559
are physicians
at the Royal Seoul Hospital.

294
00:23:55,642 --> 00:23:57,018
Less than ten total.

295
00:23:57,102 --> 00:23:59,771
Is Her Majesty's brother one of the ten?

296
00:23:59,855 --> 00:24:01,273
Yes, sir. Both of them.

297
00:24:04,192 --> 00:24:06,987
When will the Royal Seoul Hospital,
including them, be investigated?

298
00:24:07,571 --> 00:24:08,822
Well…

299
00:24:08,905 --> 00:24:09,948
Start now.

300
00:24:12,826 --> 00:24:13,910
Yes, sir. Understood.

301
00:24:30,302 --> 00:24:32,554
You should head to the palace
when you're done here.

302
00:24:33,472 --> 00:24:34,973
My wife is at the hospital.

303
00:24:35,056 --> 00:24:37,476
When the day breaks,
she will be escorted to the palace.

304
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:40,061
The palace will be safest for both of you.

305
00:24:44,483 --> 00:24:47,486
It is also the place
where you hold complete control.

306
00:24:48,320 --> 00:24:49,321
I shall handle

307
00:24:50,280 --> 00:24:51,490
all the matters beyond it.

308
00:24:57,537 --> 00:24:59,623
Your Royal Highness,
are you doing all right?

309
00:24:59,706 --> 00:25:01,833
The Grand Princess shall reside
in Anhwadang Hall.

310
00:25:01,917 --> 00:25:04,377
Pardon? But the private residence is
where she must...

311
00:25:04,461 --> 00:25:06,838
I will also assign new palace attendants.

312
00:25:08,089 --> 00:25:10,300
Royal security will also be reinforced.

313
00:25:10,383 --> 00:25:11,426
Prepare accordingly.

314
00:25:11,510 --> 00:25:12,511
Pardon?

315
00:25:15,889 --> 00:25:17,307
What we need is a fortress.

316
00:25:28,068 --> 00:25:29,861
A CATASTROPHIC DEBUT AT COURT

317
00:25:32,239 --> 00:25:33,865
Talk about a main character moment.

318
00:25:42,165 --> 00:25:44,000
The sun's up. It's already morning.

319
00:25:45,919 --> 00:25:48,046
{\an8}PRINCE:
THE QUESTIONING WENT WELL

320
00:25:48,129 --> 00:25:49,047
{\an8}PRINCE

321
00:25:51,132 --> 00:25:53,885
- <i>Did you not sleep?</i>
- Where are you? Are you okay?

322
00:25:54,803 --> 00:25:57,264
Wait. Is Jeongwoo there with you?

323
00:25:57,889 --> 00:25:58,890
<i>No, he's not.</i>

324
00:25:59,391 --> 00:26:02,477
I mean, why would you leave
your aide here?

325
00:26:02,561 --> 00:26:04,396
There are plenty of royal guards as it is.

326
00:26:05,146 --> 00:26:06,523
That should be a fun car ride.

327
00:26:07,148 --> 00:26:08,149
What?

328
00:26:08,733 --> 00:26:10,277
Come to the palace. Both of you.

329
00:26:14,030 --> 00:26:18,368
CASTLE HOSPITAL

330
00:26:31,006 --> 00:26:32,173
<i>Huiju.</i>

331
00:26:37,971 --> 00:26:40,515
- Hello, Aide Choi.
- Hello. You're back.

332
00:26:40,599 --> 00:26:42,225
Why are you even back?

333
00:26:42,309 --> 00:26:44,185
I heard you're off to the palace soon.

334
00:26:45,687 --> 00:26:47,814
Is she really okay to be discharged now?

335
00:26:47,897 --> 00:26:51,318
Yes. The detox is complete,
so there shouldn't be any issues.

336
00:26:51,401 --> 00:26:55,030
Still, it would be best to keep her
on ECG monitoring

337
00:26:55,113 --> 00:26:57,407
at the palace for about two more days.

338
00:26:57,490 --> 00:26:58,533
I see. Thank you.

339
00:26:58,617 --> 00:26:59,659
- Thank you, sir.
- Sure.

340
00:27:02,162 --> 00:27:03,872
The palace has been notified, right?

341
00:27:04,581 --> 00:27:06,041
Yes. Anhwadang Hall already has...

342
00:27:06,124 --> 00:27:07,500
Excuse me.

343
00:27:08,084 --> 00:27:09,085
Dayeong.

344
00:27:09,711 --> 00:27:11,421
Father sent me.

345
00:27:13,465 --> 00:27:16,092
His Royal Highness also asked me for help.

346
00:27:18,219 --> 00:27:19,304
He did?

347
00:27:21,014 --> 00:27:23,099
Your right-hand woman too.

348
00:27:26,478 --> 00:27:28,730
CASTLE HOSPITAL

349
00:27:30,148 --> 00:27:33,818
Gosh, you look so pretty
even when you're sick.

350
00:27:35,904 --> 00:27:37,947
Do I really look very pretty today too?

351
00:27:38,823 --> 00:27:40,492
Yes. Always very pretty, all the time.

352
00:27:41,076 --> 00:27:42,702
Geez, I can't believe this.

353
00:27:42,786 --> 00:27:44,663
Couldn't my beauty
have taken a break today?

354
00:27:45,914 --> 00:27:47,290
Do you have a cushion on you?

355
00:27:47,374 --> 00:27:48,958
- Cushion?
- This cushion.

356
00:27:54,005 --> 00:27:56,549
You weren't lying.

357
00:27:57,884 --> 00:27:58,885
How exhausting.

358
00:28:01,388 --> 00:28:02,847
What are you doing?

359
00:28:02,931 --> 00:28:06,059
The whole country saw me collapse live.

360
00:28:06,142 --> 00:28:08,019
I can't be this pretty
when I'm discharged.

361
00:28:08,770 --> 00:28:10,438
I checked the news early this morning.

362
00:28:10,522 --> 00:28:13,483
Online trolls are spreading some bullshit
about me being a jinx

363
00:28:13,566 --> 00:28:15,527
who brought bad luck
to the palace or whatever.

364
00:28:19,072 --> 00:28:22,492
The last time Taeju was in hot water,
the sympathy card worked best too.

365
00:28:22,575 --> 00:28:23,576
Let me.

366
00:28:27,956 --> 00:28:29,082
Huiju.

367
00:28:29,165 --> 00:28:31,251
Try putting on a pitiful expression.

368
00:28:31,334 --> 00:28:32,335
Like this.

369
00:28:34,212 --> 00:28:36,131
Why go that far?

370
00:28:37,006 --> 00:28:38,216
Why not? Just try it.

371
00:28:38,299 --> 00:28:40,468
You might as well go all out.

372
00:28:40,552 --> 00:28:41,928
- There she comes!
- Here she is!

373
00:28:44,723 --> 00:28:47,517
The Prime Minister's office suggested
a possible targeted attack.

374
00:28:47,600 --> 00:28:49,728
Can you give us
an update on your condition?

375
00:28:49,811 --> 00:28:52,188
Why were you not treated
at the Royal Seoul Hospital?

376
00:28:52,272 --> 00:28:54,357
Hold on. My goodness.

377
00:29:03,324 --> 00:29:04,784
Careful, Your Royal Highness.

378
00:29:23,928 --> 00:29:24,929
<i>All right.</i>

379
00:29:25,013 --> 00:29:27,849
It might feel a bit awkward,
since this isn't our usual approach.

380
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:30,518
We're going for weak and feeble,
not tough and strong.

381
00:29:30,602 --> 00:29:32,520
But it shouldn't be that difficult.

382
00:29:33,021 --> 00:29:36,357
As the CEO of Castle Beauty,
she was a rich conglomerate heiress.

383
00:29:36,441 --> 00:29:39,444
But at the palace,
she's just a lowborn outcast.

384
00:29:39,527 --> 00:29:40,945
A CATASTROPHIC DEBUT AT COURT

385
00:29:41,029 --> 00:29:43,907
Make her out to be a tragic heroine.

386
00:29:43,990 --> 00:29:45,742
One that you'd totally want to root for.

387
00:29:45,825 --> 00:29:47,160
What's going on?

388
00:29:47,243 --> 00:29:48,661
VISIBLY GAUNT,
COUGHING CONTINUOUSLY

389
00:29:48,745 --> 00:29:50,330
<i>My friend who works at the palace</i>

390
00:29:50,413 --> 00:29:51,790
<i>told me she collapsed there once before.</i>

391
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:53,208
<i>The Queen Mother is so hard on her.</i>

392
00:29:53,291 --> 00:29:55,335
<i>If she didn't marry into the royal family,</i>

393
00:29:55,418 --> 00:29:57,045
<i>she'd be living large as an heiress.</i>

394
00:29:57,128 --> 00:29:58,421
<i>I feel bad for her.</i>

395
00:30:22,487 --> 00:30:23,488
Your Majesty.

396
00:30:23,571 --> 00:30:26,825
The Royal Secretariat submitted
this month's official schedule.

397
00:30:29,410 --> 00:30:31,579
It seems the duties
assigned to the Grand Princess

398
00:30:31,663 --> 00:30:33,039
are being redistributed.

399
00:30:33,873 --> 00:30:37,418
They are wondering how much Your Majesty
is willing to take on in her stead…

400
00:30:40,797 --> 00:30:42,632
Inform them I shall assume all her duties.

401
00:30:42,715 --> 00:30:45,677
Pardon? All of them?

402
00:30:47,345 --> 00:30:49,514
We must present ourselves
as sisters-in-law

403
00:30:49,597 --> 00:30:51,349
in perfect accord.

404
00:31:18,668 --> 00:31:20,378
How shocked you must have been.

405
00:31:25,925 --> 00:31:28,136
I hear you will be staying
at the palace for now.

406
00:31:29,387 --> 00:31:32,056
As it happens,
I have just ordered that all duties

407
00:31:32,140 --> 00:31:34,851
assigned to you be transferred to me.

408
00:31:34,934 --> 00:31:36,978
Just attend to your recovery.

409
00:31:37,061 --> 00:31:40,481
It appears
Her Royal Highness is feeling faint.

410
00:31:40,565 --> 00:31:42,775
Goodness.
Are you okay, Your Royal Highness?

411
00:31:45,904 --> 00:31:47,697
Your Majesty, Her Royal Highness...

412
00:31:47,780 --> 00:31:48,781
I heard.

413
00:31:51,075 --> 00:31:52,327
Please make your way inside.

414
00:31:57,457 --> 00:31:59,751
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

415
00:32:18,227 --> 00:32:19,979
<i>The Queen Mother shall lend</i>

416
00:32:20,063 --> 00:32:22,190
her cooperation in preparing

417
00:32:22,690 --> 00:32:25,193
a statement today,
and His Majesty by tomorrow.

418
00:32:25,860 --> 00:32:27,070
However,

419
00:32:27,570 --> 00:32:28,905
Her Majesty has indicated

420
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:32,200
she will be present
for His Majesty's statement.

421
00:32:44,837 --> 00:32:45,838
The request is denied.

422
00:32:47,674 --> 00:32:48,675
Her Majesty

423
00:32:49,342 --> 00:32:51,803
holds the dignity of the palace above all.

424
00:32:52,470 --> 00:32:54,305
I do not intend to take issue with that.

425
00:32:55,348 --> 00:32:57,767
However, I wish to ease
His Majesty's burden as much as possible.

426
00:32:59,686 --> 00:33:00,937
But His Majesty is...

427
00:33:01,020 --> 00:33:02,522
He should be capable of that much.

428
00:33:05,817 --> 00:33:08,987
He is the sovereign
of a nation, after all.

429
00:33:15,952 --> 00:33:16,953
Your Majesty?

430
00:33:17,578 --> 00:33:18,705
Aunt.

431
00:33:21,332 --> 00:33:23,126
Are you feeling all right?

432
00:33:23,710 --> 00:33:25,795
I heard you were sick.

433
00:33:25,878 --> 00:33:27,505
Ah, were you worried about me?

434
00:33:29,132 --> 00:33:31,426
I heard the police

435
00:33:31,509 --> 00:33:34,846
are coming into the palace
because you fainted.

436
00:33:35,972 --> 00:33:39,767
It is because they are curious.

437
00:33:40,351 --> 00:33:42,270
They want to know
if indigestion was to blame

438
00:33:42,353 --> 00:33:43,980
or if someone pushed me.

439
00:33:44,063 --> 00:33:46,524
No one pushed you.

440
00:33:46,607 --> 00:33:48,901
Yes.

441
00:33:48,985 --> 00:33:51,779
They are investigating
because they want to know those things.

442
00:33:53,740 --> 00:33:55,700
Aide Choi, they are asking you
questions too, right?

443
00:33:55,783 --> 00:33:58,286
Pardon? Yes, of course.

444
00:33:58,369 --> 00:34:01,122
They are asking me. Court Lady Choi too.

445
00:34:01,205 --> 00:34:02,206
You too, right?

446
00:34:02,290 --> 00:34:05,084
Even the street cats
will be questioned, Your Majesty.

447
00:34:05,168 --> 00:34:08,212
Might you be a dummy?

448
00:34:08,296 --> 00:34:09,297
Pardon?

449
00:34:09,380 --> 00:34:11,507
Cats cannot talk.

450
00:34:19,140 --> 00:34:21,059
- Your Royal Highness.
- Uncle!

451
00:34:28,316 --> 00:34:29,358
Uncle.

452
00:34:32,361 --> 00:34:33,362
Your Majesty.

453
00:35:12,276 --> 00:35:14,403
Ms. Do!

454
00:35:14,487 --> 00:35:15,905
- Hello.
- Wait.

455
00:35:16,405 --> 00:35:18,783
Now, you're Aide Do
of the Grand Prince's office.

456
00:35:20,284 --> 00:35:21,285
Right.

457
00:35:22,203 --> 00:35:23,746
Hello.

458
00:35:23,830 --> 00:35:24,956
Regarding Ms. Seong…

459
00:35:27,542 --> 00:35:28,835
It's just refusing to stick.

460
00:35:28,918 --> 00:35:30,795
I know, right?

461
00:35:31,629 --> 00:35:34,924
Thank you for helping out
with the discharge of Her Royal Highness.

462
00:35:35,007 --> 00:35:37,969
It was nothing. We're family, after all.

463
00:35:38,052 --> 00:35:39,804
Where is Her Royal Highness?

464
00:35:44,225 --> 00:35:46,894
My wife still does not know
her way around the palace.

465
00:35:46,978 --> 00:35:48,563
She will require the most attentive care.

466
00:35:49,063 --> 00:35:50,815
I will bear that in mind,
Your Royal Highness.

467
00:35:51,357 --> 00:35:55,194
Until new palace attendants are assigned,
the only people permitted in her presence

468
00:35:55,278 --> 00:35:59,282
shall be you, Aide Choi,
Aide Do, and Ms. Han Dayeong.

469
00:35:59,365 --> 00:36:02,326
- Yes, Your Royal Highness.
- Furthermore, my wife

470
00:36:02,410 --> 00:36:04,245
- has trouble sleeping...
- Your Royal Highness.

471
00:36:05,621 --> 00:36:07,206
Yes? Are you feeling unwell?

472
00:36:07,790 --> 00:36:08,791
I'd like…

473
00:36:09,876 --> 00:36:11,544
some alone time with you.

474
00:36:14,839 --> 00:36:16,507
Is that not allowed?

475
00:36:19,594 --> 00:36:20,595
No?

476
00:36:22,847 --> 00:36:23,848
Right.

477
00:36:24,432 --> 00:36:25,433
Leave us.

478
00:36:26,350 --> 00:36:27,435
Leave!

479
00:36:27,518 --> 00:36:28,519
Yes, sir.

480
00:36:42,200 --> 00:36:43,534
We must be understanding.

481
00:36:43,618 --> 00:36:44,994
They are newlyweds, after all.

482
00:36:47,330 --> 00:36:48,331
Newlyweds.

483
00:36:50,917 --> 00:36:52,335
My goodness.

484
00:37:06,140 --> 00:37:07,975
Is this why you wanted to be alone?

485
00:37:09,560 --> 00:37:10,895
You know,

486
00:37:11,437 --> 00:37:13,981
I really thought I could remain unfazed
by my new title.

487
00:37:16,150 --> 00:37:18,694
But now that everyone is calling me,
"Your Royal Highness"…

488
00:37:21,197 --> 00:37:22,698
I can't help but be a bit cautious.

489
00:37:23,824 --> 00:37:27,161
It feels like I should be
the epitome of elegance every second.

490
00:37:27,954 --> 00:37:30,998
Everyone is monitoring me,
both at the hospital and here.

491
00:37:31,082 --> 00:37:32,416
Not monitoring. Protecting.

492
00:37:37,672 --> 00:37:40,216
And the questioning? Did it go well?

493
00:37:41,968 --> 00:37:44,220
Well… I almost fell asleep.

494
00:37:45,680 --> 00:37:46,681
But it was fine.

495
00:37:51,811 --> 00:37:55,439
Listen, I've been thinking about it…

496
00:37:57,733 --> 00:38:01,195
And I think you're the one
who needs protection,

497
00:38:02,113 --> 00:38:03,739
not me.

498
00:38:10,538 --> 00:38:11,664
I know.

499
00:38:12,206 --> 00:38:13,207
What?

500
00:38:14,375 --> 00:38:15,960
How are you so calm?

501
00:38:16,043 --> 00:38:18,087
- Because I'm relieved.
- About what?

502
00:38:18,170 --> 00:38:20,923
I would be terrified right now
if you were the target.

503
00:38:22,633 --> 00:38:23,718
But if I'm the target…

504
00:38:25,886 --> 00:38:26,887
I thank the heavens.

505
00:38:42,361 --> 00:38:43,612
Have you lost your mind?

506
00:38:43,696 --> 00:38:46,574
And if you make me a widow? What then?

507
00:38:46,657 --> 00:38:48,826
Why are you thanking the heavens?

508
00:38:48,909 --> 00:38:51,871
You expect me to live
in the palace alone? Without you?

509
00:38:51,954 --> 00:38:52,955
Stop it already.

510
00:38:57,126 --> 00:38:59,295
If something terrible happens to you…

511
00:39:04,550 --> 00:39:06,010
I can't even get divorced.

512
00:39:13,309 --> 00:39:14,310
You think this is funny?

513
00:39:14,393 --> 00:39:16,562
You have a dramatic way
of expressing concern.

514
00:39:23,361 --> 00:39:24,445
Just lie down.

515
00:39:31,202 --> 00:39:32,286
You're a royal now.

516
00:39:33,412 --> 00:39:34,705
So what?

517
00:39:35,373 --> 00:39:37,416
Do I have to keep quiet
even if I'm being targeted?

518
00:39:40,086 --> 00:39:42,046
You must exercise your royal powers.

519
00:39:44,215 --> 00:39:45,216
Which are?

520
00:39:47,259 --> 00:39:48,677
INVITATION TO ROYAL ACADEMY
80TH ANNIVERSARY

521
00:39:48,761 --> 00:39:49,762
SCHEDULE OF PUBLIC EVENTS

522
00:39:52,890 --> 00:39:55,184
- Fashion Week.
- Oh, Fashion Week?

523
00:39:55,267 --> 00:39:58,229
<i>In grand assemblies,
you shall embody the pride of the realm.</i>

524
00:40:03,484 --> 00:40:04,485
Right.

525
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:09,407
<i>And in places of honor,</i>

526
00:40:10,241 --> 00:40:11,617
<i>you shall embody its glory…</i>

527
00:40:13,577 --> 00:40:14,787
to be loved?

528
00:40:17,123 --> 00:40:20,376
Who would dare harm a person who is
the nation's pride and glory?

529
00:40:22,795 --> 00:40:25,756
Does that belief embolden you
to be so reckless?

530
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:27,925
Because you are
"the nation's pride and glory"?

531
00:40:30,928 --> 00:40:32,513
I was never reckless.

532
00:40:32,596 --> 00:40:33,597
I just sometimes

533
00:40:34,557 --> 00:40:35,599
do what I want to do.

534
00:40:38,102 --> 00:40:39,186
Oh.

535
00:40:39,270 --> 00:40:41,021
- I don't know what to do.
- About what?

536
00:40:41,105 --> 00:40:42,189
Earlier, the Queen Mother

537
00:40:42,690 --> 00:40:44,900
said she'd perform
my public duties on my behalf.

538
00:40:45,484 --> 00:40:46,944
Oh, that?

539
00:40:47,570 --> 00:40:48,821
It's fine.

540
00:40:51,532 --> 00:40:52,533
I denied her request.

541
00:41:00,207 --> 00:41:02,126
There is to be no change to my schedule?

542
00:41:02,209 --> 00:41:03,544
His Royal Highness

543
00:41:04,295 --> 00:41:06,922
stated that all public duties
will be duly fulfilled,

544
00:41:08,215 --> 00:41:10,593
and that Your Majesty does not need

545
00:41:10,676 --> 00:41:11,760
to worry herself.

546
00:41:15,264 --> 00:41:17,850
It appears the Grand Prince refuses
to exercise any caution.

547
00:41:22,688 --> 00:41:25,149
Your Majesty,
Lord INPYEONG has arrived.

548
00:41:33,574 --> 00:41:34,700
Show him in.

549
00:41:44,710 --> 00:41:48,005
You should refrain from visiting
the palace for the time being.

550
00:41:54,595 --> 00:41:57,848
I fear it may give rise
to unnecessary misunderstanding.

551
00:42:02,561 --> 00:42:03,646
Your Majesty

552
00:42:04,313 --> 00:42:06,273
would do well to exercise some caution.

553
00:42:08,317 --> 00:42:09,652
Do you care to elaborate?

554
00:42:11,195 --> 00:42:13,280
I meant nothing by it.

555
00:42:13,781 --> 00:42:14,782
I…

556
00:42:16,659 --> 00:42:18,410
Only fear it may give rise

557
00:42:19,453 --> 00:42:21,080
to unnecessary misunderstanding.

558
00:42:43,894 --> 00:42:44,895
Sir.

559
00:42:53,112 --> 00:42:56,365
They discovered traces of digoxin
in a goblet used in the wedding rites.

560
00:42:58,742 --> 00:42:59,910
FORENSIC EXAMINATION REPORT

561
00:42:59,994 --> 00:43:01,829
PHOTO 1: GOBLET CONTAINING
TRACES OF DIGOXIN

562
00:43:01,912 --> 00:43:03,122
<i>They were switched then.</i>

563
00:43:03,747 --> 00:43:04,957
<i>Our goblets.</i>

564
00:43:06,375 --> 00:43:07,960
The medication he usually takes…

565
00:43:09,128 --> 00:43:10,421
Did you check those?

566
00:43:11,755 --> 00:43:13,882
What are you doing? Calm down!

567
00:43:13,966 --> 00:43:15,593
He's in danger right now!

568
00:43:20,514 --> 00:43:22,433
Sir, Ms. Lee Areum has arrived.

569
00:43:41,619 --> 00:43:43,954
What? You're really that swamped?

570
00:43:45,122 --> 00:43:47,249
There you go with that nagging again.

571
00:43:48,208 --> 00:43:50,628
I swear I'm perfectly fine.

572
00:43:50,711 --> 00:43:52,087
Stop worrying for no reason.

573
00:44:04,141 --> 00:44:05,017
Oh…

574
00:44:05,100 --> 00:44:06,852
- <i>Hello? Ms. Seong?</i>
- Hey. I'm here.

575
00:44:07,853 --> 00:44:09,021
Yeah.

576
00:44:09,688 --> 00:44:10,898
<i>Are you okay?</i>

577
00:44:10,981 --> 00:44:12,900
Yeah, so nice. I mean, it's fine.

578
00:44:13,776 --> 00:44:14,818
See you tomorrow.

579
00:44:19,281 --> 00:44:21,200
It's our first night as a married couple.

580
00:44:30,834 --> 00:44:31,919
Are you ready?

581
00:44:52,940 --> 00:44:54,066
No way.

582
00:44:54,149 --> 00:44:57,277
I'm sure no one knows their way
around the palace better than me.

583
00:44:58,153 --> 00:45:00,656
That only shows you the main pathways.

584
00:45:00,739 --> 00:45:02,366
If you want to follow that,

585
00:45:02,449 --> 00:45:04,493
you should be prepared
to walk 12,000 steps.

586
00:45:04,993 --> 00:45:05,994
Are you sure?

587
00:45:06,078 --> 00:45:07,413
You should trust me.

588
00:45:07,496 --> 00:45:08,789
If you go this way,

589
00:45:08,872 --> 00:45:10,541
you'll be in your room in ten minutes.

590
00:45:15,295 --> 00:45:17,798
When did you start working at the palace?

591
00:45:19,133 --> 00:45:20,217
What?

592
00:45:20,300 --> 00:45:23,011
I mean, you're still pretty young.

593
00:45:23,512 --> 00:45:25,639
But you know everything,
like you were born here.

594
00:45:25,723 --> 00:45:27,182
From the staff to the pathways.

595
00:45:28,642 --> 00:45:32,229
I'm not exactly sure.
I think I was five or six?

596
00:45:33,063 --> 00:45:34,064
What?

597
00:45:34,565 --> 00:45:35,899
I'm an orphan, you see.

598
00:45:37,192 --> 00:45:39,737
I heard I was abandoned
in front of the private residence.

599
00:45:41,739 --> 00:45:44,241
Sorry.

600
00:45:45,075 --> 00:45:46,076
Pardon?

601
00:45:46,160 --> 00:45:49,329
I shouldn't have asked. Right?

602
00:45:49,913 --> 00:45:51,707
Oh! No, it's perfectly fine.

603
00:45:51,790 --> 00:45:53,083
You see,

604
00:45:53,625 --> 00:45:57,004
I'm really grateful to my parents.

605
00:45:57,588 --> 00:46:00,507
I grew up surrounded by love
at the private residence.

606
00:46:00,591 --> 00:46:03,135
Of all places, I just happened
to be abandoned right in front

607
00:46:03,218 --> 00:46:04,970
of the Grand Prince's house.

608
00:46:05,721 --> 00:46:08,724
You could say
I'm sort of a "lucky guy."

609
00:46:28,368 --> 00:46:31,038
What are you doing?
We need to make it in 10 minutes.

610
00:46:31,121 --> 00:46:32,122
Right.

611
00:46:34,416 --> 00:46:35,417
What's wrong with you?

612
00:46:56,522 --> 00:46:59,691
Will you not even consider the sofa?

613
00:46:59,775 --> 00:47:00,776
No.

614
00:47:01,443 --> 00:47:02,903
This is perfectly fine.

615
00:47:03,695 --> 00:47:05,405
The sofa would be perfectly fine too.

616
00:47:06,198 --> 00:47:07,407
Then you should go.

617
00:47:08,492 --> 00:47:09,785
That'd be perfect.

618
00:47:13,163 --> 00:47:14,373
I'm the patient here.

619
00:47:25,092 --> 00:47:26,510
Seriously?

620
00:47:29,972 --> 00:47:31,265
Just sleep already.

621
00:47:31,348 --> 00:47:33,892
Want everyone to think
I was cast aside on our first night?

622
00:48:00,586 --> 00:48:02,254
Should we turn that off?

623
00:48:06,049 --> 00:48:07,050
Just leave it.

624
00:48:09,344 --> 00:48:10,846
But it's so loud.

625
00:48:12,472 --> 00:48:14,224
It's proof you're alive.

626
00:48:22,357 --> 00:48:23,358
I like the sound of it.

627
00:48:41,501 --> 00:48:42,836
I'm just reassuring you.

628
00:48:44,796 --> 00:48:46,298
I'm right here.

629
00:49:45,399 --> 00:49:48,151
Both her blood pressure
and pulse are stable.

630
00:49:48,235 --> 00:49:49,277
Thank you.

631
00:49:50,445 --> 00:49:51,446
Ms. Do...

632
00:49:52,197 --> 00:49:53,198
Aide Do!

633
00:49:53,991 --> 00:49:55,033
Yes?

634
00:50:00,163 --> 00:50:01,581
I didn't call for you.

635
00:50:01,665 --> 00:50:05,168
I know, but you should ask for me
for the time being.

636
00:50:05,252 --> 00:50:08,046
I will be the chief aide
of the Grand Princess for now.

637
00:50:08,130 --> 00:50:09,297
Why?

638
00:50:09,381 --> 00:50:11,550
Because you'll need
an experienced aide

639
00:50:11,633 --> 00:50:14,344
well-versed in royal duties by your side

640
00:50:14,428 --> 00:50:16,054
to facilitate your swift transition.

641
00:50:16,138 --> 00:50:18,306
Th-Then what about my Ms. Do?

642
00:50:18,390 --> 00:50:19,558
Where is my Hyejeong?

643
00:50:20,434 --> 00:50:22,602
- What did you do with her?
- She's safe.

644
00:50:22,686 --> 00:50:23,854
Hyejeong!

645
00:50:23,937 --> 00:50:27,107
It's a Royal Academy event,
so security shouldn't be a major issue.

646
00:50:27,190 --> 00:50:30,027
It's a small-scale event
that will be held indoors.

647
00:50:33,613 --> 00:50:36,408
You should be familiar
with most of the guests.

648
00:50:36,491 --> 00:50:37,868
They're all former students.

649
00:50:51,214 --> 00:50:52,841
Anyone I should be mindful of?

650
00:50:53,592 --> 00:50:54,718
Prime Minister Min Jeongwoo.

651
00:50:54,801 --> 00:50:56,595
He is set to deliver the opening address.

652
00:50:56,678 --> 00:50:58,805
Your Royal Highness
will present the scholarship.

653
00:51:08,899 --> 00:51:11,902
There are a few protocols
you must follow during official duties.

654
00:51:11,985 --> 00:51:15,030
First, you must never walk
ahead of His Royal Highness.

655
00:51:15,113 --> 00:51:18,909
Hold on. This was something I mentioned
for the Inner Court Banquet as well.

656
00:51:19,451 --> 00:51:21,745
Court rank is very important
in official events.

657
00:51:21,828 --> 00:51:23,914
I understand.

658
00:51:24,581 --> 00:51:26,041
Yes. Thank you.

659
00:51:26,124 --> 00:51:29,002
You will sometimes come across
people who hand you flowers or letters.

660
00:51:29,086 --> 00:51:30,337
You should accept all of them.

661
00:51:30,420 --> 00:51:32,089
- All of them?
- Yes, all of them.

662
00:51:32,172 --> 00:51:34,466
And your photo could be taken at any time.

663
00:51:34,549 --> 00:51:36,009
So try not to appear

664
00:51:36,093 --> 00:51:38,470
expressionless or put on that face
you just gave me.

665
00:51:38,553 --> 00:51:40,305
There you go again.

666
00:51:40,388 --> 00:51:41,932
You cannot do that.

667
00:51:42,516 --> 00:51:46,436
Also, you must observe rank when offering
a handshake or initiating a conversation.

668
00:51:46,520 --> 00:51:49,439
His Royal Highness is first.
You come second.

669
00:51:49,523 --> 00:51:52,400
Does that mean no one can speak to me
if I don't speak to them first?

670
00:51:52,484 --> 00:51:53,568
Correct.

671
00:51:53,652 --> 00:51:55,529
And you can never show bare feet.

672
00:51:55,612 --> 00:51:58,573
If there are no slippers available,
please keep your shoes on.

673
00:51:58,657 --> 00:52:01,618
Crossing your legs while seated
is strictly forbidden,

674
00:52:01,701 --> 00:52:02,786
so please be careful.

675
00:52:02,869 --> 00:52:05,997
No peace signs or finger hearts
when being photographed.

676
00:52:06,081 --> 00:52:07,874
Cheek hearts? Definitely not.

677
00:52:08,375 --> 00:52:10,502
Then what exactly am I supposed to do?

678
00:52:10,585 --> 00:52:12,170
Something simple.

679
00:52:13,130 --> 00:52:14,714
Maybe a simple wave?

680
00:52:19,803 --> 00:52:21,930
I should wear this one today.

681
00:52:22,013 --> 00:52:24,850
I should do my part to boost
our affiliate's revenue again.

682
00:52:25,684 --> 00:52:26,893
What do you think?

683
00:52:26,977 --> 00:52:28,145
Good choice.

684
00:52:29,813 --> 00:52:31,356
So pretty. Hmm.

685
00:52:33,525 --> 00:52:35,068
Ready to go?

686
00:52:37,654 --> 00:52:39,072
I will be after you change.

687
00:52:40,824 --> 00:52:42,993
Why? Do I look weird?

688
00:52:43,827 --> 00:52:46,496
It's our first official appearance
as a married couple.

689
00:52:46,580 --> 00:52:49,040
Our outfits should look coordinated.

690
00:52:49,124 --> 00:52:52,002
Such a gloomy outfit. Right?

691
00:52:52,085 --> 00:52:53,545
My thoughts exactly.

692
00:52:55,255 --> 00:52:56,506
Just look at it.

693
00:52:56,590 --> 00:52:57,966
So shiny!

694
00:52:58,049 --> 00:52:59,134
Wow.

695
00:52:59,634 --> 00:53:01,678
We must leave a record of this. Right?

696
00:53:01,761 --> 00:53:03,555
All right now. Here we go.

697
00:53:03,638 --> 00:53:04,973
Look right over here.

698
00:53:05,473 --> 00:53:07,225
Let's try smiling.

699
00:53:07,309 --> 00:53:08,768
Oh, my gosh.

700
00:53:08,852 --> 00:53:10,270
- Oh, my goodness.
- Shall we?

701
00:53:10,854 --> 00:53:12,147
Shall we take this to the hallway?

702
00:53:12,230 --> 00:53:14,232
Come on now. Here we go.

703
00:53:15,817 --> 00:53:17,319
Does it look gloomy?

704
00:53:17,402 --> 00:53:20,030
Absolutely not.
You look so cool right now.

705
00:53:20,113 --> 00:53:21,114
"Gloomy"?

706
00:53:21,198 --> 00:53:23,992
How could she say that
to the world's most handsome man?

707
00:53:29,664 --> 00:53:31,708
- Sir.
- I was actually just on my way out.

708
00:53:31,791 --> 00:53:33,210
You need to take a look at this.

709
00:53:44,179 --> 00:53:46,598
Criticism of the Crown
will be unavoidable.

710
00:53:46,681 --> 00:53:47,641
What do you think?

711
00:54:28,348 --> 00:54:29,724
Aren't we going inside?

712
00:54:30,767 --> 00:54:32,185
Enough of that. Take my arm.

713
00:54:33,311 --> 00:54:35,105
Why? I'm busy being loved.

714
00:54:35,188 --> 00:54:37,816
Go on without me.

715
00:54:45,031 --> 00:54:46,199
They look so affectionate.

716
00:54:46,700 --> 00:54:47,701
I know, right?

717
00:55:09,889 --> 00:55:12,350
I made it so crystal clear

718
00:55:12,434 --> 00:55:15,020
that you can't do these finger hearts…

719
00:55:15,103 --> 00:55:16,438
Please stop that.

720
00:55:16,521 --> 00:55:18,064
Come on now.

721
00:55:18,148 --> 00:55:19,774
P-Please stop, Your Royal Highness.

722
00:55:20,567 --> 00:55:21,776
Yes, sure.

723
00:55:22,277 --> 00:55:23,320
Thank you.

724
00:55:24,904 --> 00:55:27,407
Your Royal Highness,
that was the prime minister's office.

725
00:55:27,490 --> 00:55:28,867
He's going to be a little late.

726
00:55:28,950 --> 00:55:30,285
- Really?
- Jeongwoo is?

727
00:55:30,952 --> 00:55:31,953
Can you…

728
00:55:32,662 --> 00:55:34,706
stop addressing him like that?

729
00:55:36,833 --> 00:55:38,626
I'm not supposed to call him by his name?

730
00:55:38,710 --> 00:55:42,005
- "Prime Minister Min."
- You should first review this.

731
00:55:42,589 --> 00:55:43,840
Why?

732
00:55:43,923 --> 00:55:45,467
They sent over the opening address.

733
00:55:45,967 --> 00:55:47,761
Since he is presenting the scholarships,

734
00:55:47,844 --> 00:55:50,597
wouldn't it be nice
if you delivered the opening address?

735
00:56:08,114 --> 00:56:10,158
Hello, I am Seong Huiju.

736
00:56:15,622 --> 00:56:17,374
Being back at my alma mater,

737
00:56:17,957 --> 00:56:20,251
I feel like I should be
introducing myself by saying,

738
00:56:20,335 --> 00:56:22,003
"I am Seong Huiju of Jujak House."

739
00:56:23,338 --> 00:56:26,132
Another part of me wants to celebrate
my success since graduating

740
00:56:27,217 --> 00:56:29,469
by presenting myself
as Seong Huiju, the Executive Director

741
00:56:30,053 --> 00:56:31,471
of Castle Group.

742
00:56:32,680 --> 00:56:36,309
However, I am sure
all of you would most like to hear,

743
00:56:38,144 --> 00:56:39,187
"Hello,

744
00:56:40,021 --> 00:56:41,689
I am Grand Princess Seong Huiju."

745
00:56:43,525 --> 00:56:44,651
Am I right?

746
00:56:50,782 --> 00:56:52,450
She's unbelievable.

747
00:56:54,577 --> 00:56:56,454
She's so good, isn't she?

748
00:57:16,808 --> 00:57:18,059
Eighty years ago,

749
00:57:18,643 --> 00:57:20,645
when the Royal Academy was founded,

750
00:57:20,728 --> 00:57:23,690
the Crown pursued but one ideal.

751
00:57:24,649 --> 00:57:27,735
Any who aspired to become something

752
00:57:28,653 --> 00:57:29,988
shall be allowed to do so,

753
00:57:30,613 --> 00:57:32,949
without regard to background

754
00:57:33,658 --> 00:57:34,951
or gender.

755
00:57:35,034 --> 00:57:38,538
I, too, was a beneficiary of that mission,

756
00:57:39,581 --> 00:57:40,748
and as you can see,

757
00:57:41,332 --> 00:57:45,211
I managed to make
all my aspirations a reality.

758
00:57:47,839 --> 00:57:48,882
Your Royal Highness.

759
00:57:57,974 --> 00:58:00,894
A PERSON OF VIRTUE
TAKES RIGHTEOUSNESS…

760
00:58:00,977 --> 00:58:02,395
TAKEN AS FOUNDATION

761
00:58:07,275 --> 00:58:08,693
There is an emergency, Your Majesty.

762
00:58:09,944 --> 00:58:11,404
What is it?

763
00:58:11,488 --> 00:58:14,073
If there is something that you want,

764
00:58:15,074 --> 00:58:16,075
do not hesitate…

765
00:58:16,159 --> 00:58:18,286
…and claim it for yourself.

766
00:58:20,747 --> 00:58:23,166
As your senior alum and patron,

767
00:58:24,042 --> 00:58:26,377
with ironclad resolve…

768
00:58:33,510 --> 00:58:35,595
With ironclad resolve…

769
00:58:40,475 --> 00:58:42,977
Your Royal Highness!

770
00:58:43,061 --> 00:58:45,730
Do you have anything to say for yourself?

771
00:58:45,813 --> 00:58:47,440
Did you deceive the people?

772
00:58:47,524 --> 00:58:50,068
There was a confidentiality
clause. What are you hiding?

773
00:58:51,402 --> 00:58:53,863
EXCLUSIVE: THE ROYAL COUPLE'S
MARRIAGE CONTRACT LEAKED

774
00:58:57,283 --> 00:58:59,536
Is it true that that
the marriage is contractual?

775
00:58:59,619 --> 00:59:02,163
Is it true
you plan to divorce in three years?

776
00:59:02,247 --> 00:59:03,540
Please respond!

777
00:59:10,421 --> 00:59:11,965
Was there consent from the royal family?

778
00:59:12,048 --> 00:59:14,259
What has Castle Group promised the Crown?

779
00:59:44,163 --> 00:59:45,415
What are you doing?

780
00:59:47,667 --> 00:59:48,668
Keep your eyes on me.

781
01:00:22,952 --> 01:00:25,872
PERFECT CROWN

782
01:01:01,908 --> 01:01:04,285
Is it true that
the marriage is contractual?

783
01:01:04,369 --> 01:01:05,995
<i>This is about to blow up
in our face.</i>

784
01:01:06,079 --> 01:01:09,582
<i>You thought you could protect
yourself with that measly contract?</i>

785
01:01:10,166 --> 01:01:12,377
I shall set the record straight myself.

786
01:01:12,460 --> 01:01:14,379
Can Your Majesty prove it?

787
01:01:14,462 --> 01:01:16,464
Do you think I'm oblivious
to your scheming?

788
01:01:16,547 --> 01:01:17,548
Your Royal Highness!

789
01:01:18,549 --> 01:01:19,967
<i>You said it was all for show.</i>

790
01:01:20,051 --> 01:01:21,427
{\an8}<i>You and the Grand Prince.</i>

791
01:01:22,345 --> 01:01:23,513
{\an8}<i>I like him.</i>

792
01:01:24,013 --> 01:01:25,098
{\an8}<i>A lot.</i>

793
01:01:26,265 --> 01:01:27,183
{\an8}HUIJU

794
01:01:27,266 --> 01:01:29,018
{\an8}<i>His Royal Highness remains unaware.</i>

795
01:01:29,102 --> 01:01:30,353
{\an8}<i>How does it feel?</i>

796
01:01:30,436 --> 01:01:31,854
{\an8}<i>What do I have to do?</i>

797
01:01:33,523 --> 01:01:34,524
{\an8}<i>Are you scared?</i>

798
01:01:35,441 --> 01:01:37,652
{\an8}<i>I'm scared I might end up</i>

799
01:01:37,735 --> 01:01:38,778
{\an8}<i>ruining you.</i>

800
01:01:44,826 --> 01:01:49,038
{\an8}EPILOGUE

801
01:01:59,716 --> 01:02:02,510
{\an8}Your Royal Highness,
it is Court Lady Choi.

802
01:02:04,220 --> 01:02:05,680
{\an8}Your Royal Highness.

803
01:02:08,850 --> 01:02:10,143
{\an8}Your Royal Highness!

804
01:02:19,485 --> 01:02:21,154
{\an8}Are you awake?

805
01:02:24,824 --> 01:02:26,617
{\an8}Should I just go in there?

806
01:02:26,701 --> 01:02:27,994
{\an8}Would that be okay?

807
01:02:28,494 --> 01:02:29,871
{\an8}IF YOU WAKE UP
THE GRAND PRINCESS…

808
01:02:29,954 --> 01:02:31,038
{\an8}- Your Royal High...
- Stop.

809
01:02:32,623 --> 01:02:34,333
{\an8}He says to keep it down.

810
01:02:35,126 --> 01:02:36,210
{\an8}Pardon me?

811
01:02:36,294 --> 01:02:38,379
{\an8}He says if we wake
the Grand Princess…

812
01:02:38,463 --> 01:02:39,756
{\an8}…there will be hell to pay.

813
01:02:44,135 --> 01:02:46,429
{\an8}- Should we go get some breakfast?
- Shall we?

814
01:02:47,972 --> 01:02:49,015
{\an8}What are you craving?

815
01:02:49,098 --> 01:02:51,517
{\an8}There's a place with amazing pajeon
right by here.

816
01:03:31,891 --> 01:03:33,893
{\an8}Translated by Justin S. Kim

817
01:03:45,196 --> 01:03:48,908
PERFECT CROWN
